  "caption": "The video captures a nighttime outdoor scene lit by a bright orange street lamp on a curved pole at right-center. A dark silhouetted utility pole with a T-shaped crossarm stands at left-center, with a smaller distant light glowing below it. Masses of trees frame the left and right edges, some left-side leaves catching the warm lamp light. Fine diagonal rain streaks fall continuously through the lamp's glowing halo, an ongoing rainfall that continues through the scene.\n\nThe rain keeps descending in steady diagonal threads, illuminated where it passes through the lamp's amber halo. Outside the glow, the streaks remain faint against the black sky. Small bright points scattered within the foliage on both sides provide additional glints among the leaves. The lamp's glow and the positions of the poles and trees remain largely stable, with no obvious camera pan or movement of the poles and trees. Only minor fluctuations in the brightness and extent of the halo and the lit rain are visible.",
